---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I am a Clinical Research professional with extensive experience in biostatistics, data management, and automation. 
		My mission is to leverage technology to accelerate the delivery of life-saving treatments to patients.
	</p>

	<h2>Professional Experience</h2>
	<p>
		With 7 years of experience in the pharmaceutical and CRO industry, I have developed a deep understanding of 
		clinical trial phases (0-III) and the regulatory landscape. My work focuses on:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Automating SDTM and ADaM dataset generation to speed up clinical reporting.</li>
		<li>Implementing Risk-Based Monitoring (RBM) and real-time data quality tracking.</li>
		<li>Developing robust, validated R-based tools for biostatistics and data management teams.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Resumes</h2>
	<p>You can download my latest resumes below:</p>
	<div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px;">
		<a href={`${base}/resumes/CV_final.pdf`} class="download-button" download>
			📄 Final CV (PDF)
		</a>
		<a href={`${base}/resumes/SiriyakCR- Biostatistician (2).pdf`} class="download-button" download>
			📄 Biostatistician Resume (PDF)
		</a>
	</div>

	<style>
		.download-button {
			display: inline-block;
			padding: 10px 20px;
			background-color: #004a99;
			color: white;
			text-decoration: none;
			border-radius: 5px;
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		.download-button:hover {
			background-color: #003366;
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
